{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_design_tokens_semantic_tokens", "label": "Semantic design tokens (role-based color contract)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "1-33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The previous class names mixed appearance (zinc-*), accent (green-*) and meaning; semantic tokens make palettes primitives and tokens the public contract so adding a theme or accent is not a search-and-replace exercise and light mode no longer needs a large !important remap."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_source_of_truth", "label": "Token source of truth (palettes.ts, tokens.ts, appearance.ts, boot.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "34-47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The catalog is defined once in TypeScript; the CSS layer maps names to runtime variables and must not define a second set of color values."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_runtime_flow", "label": "Theme runtime flow (pre-paint -> boot.ts -> AppSettingsProvider)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "49-74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "React never rewrites class names on theme change; only CSS custom properties on <html> change, so the themed surface is independent of the component tree."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_tailwind_mapping", "label": "Tailwind v4 @theme inline token mapping", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "76-99, 313", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "@theme inline makes generated utilities reference the runtime variables directly, avoiding a duplicated palette in CSS."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_legacy_remap", "label": "Bounded legacy zinc/green compatibility remap region", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "190-211, 325-334", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It is an explicitly temporary bridge so unmigrated components still follow theme changes; it must only shrink, must receive no new selectors, and is enforced by the static checker."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_pdfjs_isolated", "label": "Isolated PDF.js viewer theming via CMD_SET_THEME and --lyceum-* variables", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "230-253", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The viewer runs in its own document/origin and does not inherit parent CSS variables, so the host must post resolved token values over the versioned bridge instead of styling the host element."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_epub_theme", "label": "EPUB content theme independence (light/dark/sepia)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "255-265, 344-345", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chapter content renders in its own document and cannot inherit host variables; keeping it independent from the app accent preserves a consistent reading surface, at the cost of not following accent changes."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_static_checker", "label": "check-design-tokens.mjs static token checker", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "304-323", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guards token completeness, mapping, pre-paint fallback drift, generated PDF core currency, and keeps the legacy remap from growing."}, {"id": "docs_design_tokens_fouc", "label": "FOUC prevention at HTML, boot module and Electron window levels", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "213-228", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The main process only knows the OS appearance, not the renderer's stored explicit preference, so the pre-paint script closes that gap for the page itself."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_design_tokens_semantic_tokens", "target": "docs_design_tokens_source_of_truth", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "34-47", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_semantic_tokens", "target": "docs_design_tokens_tailwind_mapping", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "76-99", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_semantic_tokens", "target": "docs_design_tokens_legacy_remap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "190-211", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_runtime_flow", "target": "docs_design_tokens_source_of_truth", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "49-74", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_runtime_flow", "target": "index_prepaint_theme_script", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "51-59, 215-221", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_fouc", "target": "index_prepaint_theme_script", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-tokens.md", "source_location": "215-228", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_tokens_fouc", "target": "architecture_electron_main", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "sour